# RHF/STO-3G GIAO (London-orbital) NMR nuclear magnetic shielding of H2O.
# Gauge-including atomic orbitals make the shielding gauge-origin independent.
# The nmr(...) modifier adds the shielding property to the energy run.
rhf/sto-3g
nmr(gauge=giao)
guess(type=huckel)
geom="""
O   0.000000000   0.000000000  -0.041061554
H  -0.533194329   0.533194329  -0.614469223
H   0.533194329  -0.533194329  -0.614469223
"""
